      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i'm trying to really kickstart my weight loss and i heard combining caffeine and green tea extract is great for metabolism. i drink like 4-5 cups of coffee a day normally so i have a pretty high tolerance lol. what’s the max dose i can take of both together in the morning for the best results? i want to go big to see if i can get a real boost.",
