    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get the jitters thing but i'm pretty much immune to it since i drink so much coffee anyway. i'm more interested in the actual numbers for the metabolism boost. like if i'm taking a supplement, how many milligrams of caffeine and how many mg of the extract is the absolute upper limit for a morning routine? i want to know what the high end is so i can optimize it.",
